# SCOUT.flow

```text
[SCOUT]
  Owner: ✎

  ROLE: convert Outside into Thought

  SENSE ──► FILTER ──► Thought(origin=scout)
                │
                ▼
         Collective Memory

  FILTER rules are local and mutable by Consensus only.

  INVARIANT:
    Scout never authorizes.
    Scout never acts on the external world except to observe.
```
